  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.ORM v4.6.1\n\nHoloNET ORM — a powerful Object Relational Mapping layer for Holochain hApps built on HoloNET Client. Supports Holochain 0.7.1 and 0.7.0. Map .NET classes directly to Rust DHT entry structs with HoloNETEntryBase and HoloNETAuditEntryBase. Batch-load entire DHT collections with HoloNETCollection<T>. Bind WPF/XAML UIs reactively with HoloNETObservableCollection<T>. Full CRUD (LoadAsync, SaveAsync, DeleteAsync), change tracking, version control, and one-method rollback — all without writing any conductor wire-protocol code. Converts any existing .NET app to a Holochain hApp with minimal changes. Ships as both lightweight (no binaries) and embedded (hc.exe + holochain.exe bundled) variants. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp\n\nWhat's new since v4.6.0\n- Advance the HoloNET-ORM gitlink and pin to the published HoloNET 4.6.0 source (85287e5) (fcb46ff)\n- Release 2026-11-11-10: re-pin WEB6, OGEngineClient and HoloNET-ORM to submodule main (61b91d8)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/HoloNET-ORM",
